  Q.random_seed = Math.floor(Math.random() * 6);
  console.log("Random Seed: " + Q.random_seed);

  switch (Q.random_seed) {
    default:
      Q.random_seed_quote_text = "I like Catalan people because they do \"stuff\".";
      Q.random_seed_author = "Mariano Rajoy, Presidente del Gobierno, 2017";
    case 0:
      Q.random_seed_quote_text = "We deserve to be stompped by all the sons of Aznar and Don Pelayo if we don't manage to agree with eachother.";
      Q.random_seed_author = "Gabriel Rufian, ERC MP at the Congreso, 2019";
      break;
    case 1:
      Q.random_seed_quote_text = "We were going slow, because we were going far.";
      Q.random_seed_author = "CUP's post-election negotiation motto, circa 2015";
      break;
    case 2:
      Q.random_seed_quote_text = "Everything is ready for the desconnection \[independence\]. All that will be needed is to press a button."
      Q.random_seed_author = "Carles Viver Pi-Sunyer, Parlament's Comissioner for the National Transition, 2015";
      break;
    case 3:
      Q.random_seed_quote_text = "I am not asking for a single euro, just for an agreement.";
      Q.random_seed_author = "Artur Mas, President de la Generalitat, 2012";
      break;
    case 4:
      Q.random_seed_quote_text = "\"What cannot be, cannot be, on top of that it is impossible.\"";
      Q.random_seed_author = "Mariano Rajoy, Presidente del Gobierno, 2017";
      break;
  }
!}
set-bg: img/3rd_October_2017.jpg
new-page: true

> *[+ random_seed_quote_text +]*

 - [+ random_seed_author +]

This is a game of alternate history. While historical accuracy is a major concern, keep in mind that this is a *game*, and that any divergence from actual events will necessarily have to involve some element of make-believe. Nevertheless, please let the author know if there are any glaring mistakes.

For more information on the politics, government, and recent history of Catalonia, please see the Library page on the top left. If this is your first time playing the game, it is strongly recommended that you read at least some of this information.

[? if debug: **DEBUG** mode is toggled (!) - you should not be seeing this unless you are testing sutff :) ?]

- @easy_mode : <span style="color: #5B9A8D;font-weight: bold;">Easy</span> mode
- @normal_mode : <span style="color: #C4B156;font-weight: bold;">Normal</span> mode
- @hard_mode : <span style="color: rgb(148, 27, 6);font-weight: bold;">Hard</span> mode
- @historical_mode : <span style="color: rgb(69, 23, 2);font-weight: bold;">Historical</span> mode

